{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45717","headline":"送卢舍人三首 三 · 贯休","name":"送卢舍人三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三曰：君不见释梵诸天寿亿垓，天上人间去复来。\n君又不见紫金爲轮一千幅，宝洲□四皆臣伏。\n轮王释梵作何因，祗是弘隆大乘福。\n自古皇王与贤哲，顶敬心师刻金玉。\n报通三世释迦言，莫将梁武爲题目。\n君不见近代韦裴蒋与萧，文房书府师百僚。\n代天理物映千古，布发掩泥非一朝。\n大哉释梵轮王璞，已矣何人继先觉。\n行行珍重寄斯言，斯言不是寻常曲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45717.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45717","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}